 Preserve orchestration boundary, run-scoped violation sink, and light bug tier. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/plan_review/registry.py:1-46, 215-226, 253-262` — Preserve prompt/routing sources and registry APIs. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/plan_review/resign.py:1-30, 445-455` — Preserve cheap-resign preconditions and unsigned classifications. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/plan_review/sidecar.py:297-308, 362-379, 418-454` — Preserve fingerprints, recall provenance, surfaced decisions, and prior-concern eligibility. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/prompting/prompt_library.py:1-38` — Preserve enumerate/write surfaces and packaged-index invariant. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/prompting/prompt_model.py:1-37, 48-59, 165-185` — Preserve prompt types, strict rendering, execution mode, and volatile markers. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/review_kernel/__init__.py:1-31` — Preserve shared Pass 2-4 ownership versus gate-specific concerns. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/review_kernel/decide.py:337-371, 426-461` — Preserve kind-specific mappings, hard overrides, and plan-impact formula. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/run_failure.py:1-18, 53-72, 132-141, 179-197` — Preserve ordered classification and exception-type selection. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/runner.py:137-147, 430-442, 488-505, 639-648` — Preserve stable cache prefix, provider session, capability routing, and cache diagnostics. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/step_failures.py:1-37` — Preserve run-scoped nonfatal tally and locked increments. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/structured_run.py:1-24, 399-411, 443-466` — Preserve resolved-model clamp and request/tool budget derivation. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/structured.py:1-32, 66-124, 220-259, 419-430` — Preserve native eligibility, schema-complexity bound, fallback, and array unwrapping. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/usage_log.py:61-72, 91-101, 542-568, 617-646` — Preserve outcome-on-every-row, step context, redaction, and failure accounting. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/workflow/completion_verdict_cache.py:1-26` — Preserve PASS-only scoped cache, atomic writes, and best-effort behavior. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make test`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/plan_review/guide_parity.py","reason":"Current surviving comment/docstring remediation scope at origin/main 91c31